  "name": "AssemblyAI",
  "label": "AssemblyAI",
  "description": "Official AssemblyAI v2 transcripts (POST/GET) plus upload on INPUT input → OUTPUT output. realtime is ingress (Streaming WebSocket is not opened). Auth is StudioQuack secret api_key sent as authorization (no Bearer). Audio uses type file on upload. Docs: https://www.assemblyai.com/docs/api-reference/transcripts/submit. Terms: https://www.assemblyai.com/legal/terms-of-service. Never log api_key. LeMUR dropped (LLM Gateway is a different host). Errors raise a BPMN error for the error boundary event (INVALID_INPUT, AUTH_FAILED, RATE_LIMITED, HTTP_<status>, REQUEST_FAILED); secrets are redacted.",
  "icon": "mic",
  "tags": [
    "assemblyai",
    "ai"
  ],
  "category": "AI & Machine Learning",
